WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.820
Bury your gold and never spend it,
and the Qur'an warns against it.

2
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.750
Waste it all, and it
warns against that too.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.470
It also says that God has permitted trade
and forbidden usury, meaning interest.

4
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.250
For Muslims, one kind of
giving is a pillar of faith.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.410
Its name means purification, and growth.

6
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.260
So what does Islam think money is for?

7
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.330
In this mission, you'll read
who should receive this giving,

8
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.030
according to the Qur'an.

9
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.520
Then you'll compare
different kinds of giving,

10
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.990
and see how Sunni and Shi'a
Muslims read one verse differently.

11
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.030
Your mission: find out what
Muslims believe wealth is for,

12
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:41.170
and how each kind of giving works.
